Spec: Restaurant Landing Page

Purpose:
  Help visitors browse Bar Plaza's menu and find its contact details.

Owns:
  ./index.astro

Must:
  The page uses one main landmark, a logical heading order, and named navigation landmarks.
  Every meaningful image has descriptive alternative text.
  Menu pages can be opened and dismissed with native keyboard-accessible dialog behavior.
  Phone and address are actionable contact information.
  Unconfirmed opening hours are not stated as fact.

Must not:
  Embed photos from third-party directories or claim menu photographs depict the restaurant interior.

Done when:
  The built page contains semantic landmarks and the contact actions remain usable without JavaScript.
